  "title": "Christmas Tree Cheese Ball",
  "description": "Your cheese ball will be the hit of the party when you shape it into a Christmas tree shape and cover it with chopped parsley &#39;needles&#39; and pecan and bell pepper &#39;garlands&#39;.",
